# NAV-LINK - a semoraai.com link that the app claims (/invite/...) but cannot
# read (a value over 256 characters), opened while a screen is pushed over the
# tabs. app/+native-intent.tsx sends it home: the root stack must end at
# exactly one screen, on the tabs. Needs a build with the applinks entitlement
# (1.15.2 or later) and the simulator able to fetch semoraai.com's association
# file; without them iOS opens Safari and this scenario fails at assert-tabs.
launch
sleep 5
tapif Cerrar/Close
rootstack launch expect=1
note 1 - from Settings -> Canvas & LMS
openurl semora://settings/lms
sleep 4
rootstack on-settings-lms expect=2
openurl https://semoraai.
sleep 4
tapif Cerrar/Close
assert-tabs site-link-home
rootstack site-link-home expect=1
note 2 - again, from a screen two levels deep
openurl semora://settings/lms
sleep 3
openurl semora://settings/lms-connect?provider=blackboard
sleep 4
rootstack two-deep expect=3
openurl https://semoraai.
sleep 4
tapif Cerrar/Close
assert-tabs site-link-home-2
rootstack site-link-home-2 expect=1
